906
01:04:44,356 --> 01:04:45,256
noktasında

907
01:04:45,256 --> 01:04:45,516
hani

908
01:04:45,516 --> 01:04:46,655
ortak faydalar

909
01:04:46,655 --> 01:04:47,356
